    "mathematics": "Exactly three quadrants requires Delta>0 and f(0)>=0, giving k=-1,2,3,4,5 and m=5. Integer roots require k^2-k-1 to be a square; only k=-1,2 survive, and only k=-1 has a positive integer root, so n=1."
